# tally 2.2 (CHANGES.md 2.2-10, pick P14; E §7 step 1): a cell no random fact reaches is shared by every path,
# unless its cone holds a def keyed by a movement, which a path may draw. fx3's in_pln under paths, the movement's
# amount random (a bonus of 0 or 1 times amt[work]): by_helper equals the inline sum by_inline on every line, per
# work and per path. tally 2.1.8 printed the helper's first cell, 800.00 PLN, under no and in every mean.
=== m.tally
model fx3p
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.2 G1 (#211, plan §3): fx3's def keyed by a movement under paths, the movement's amount random (a bonus of 0 or 1 times amt[work], binomial at one half): the paths' shared cell of in_pln[t] reads the same graph as the axes and the pins, so by_helper splits by work and by path as by_inline does. pm: the means over 40 paths, per work; p3: path 3 replayed."

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
axis work
  yes "in work"
  no "not in work"
place wallet: accounts EUR lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input fx: num PLN/EUR
input d1: date
input amt[w in work]: money EUR
input mo: month
input p_bonus: num

def bonus: dist = binomial(1, p_bonus) at reader

def pay: money EUR at reader
  rule base = round(amt[work] * (1 + bonus), minor(EUR), half-up)

move in1: transfers
  on d1
  at d1
  leg cash from world to wallet amount pay

def in_pln[t in transfers]: money PLN = round(t.cash.amount * fx, minor(PLN), half-up) at t.day

def by_inline: money PLN at reader
  rule base = sum(round(t.cash.amount * fx, minor(PLN), half-up) for t in transfers over mo where t.cash.to == wallet)
def by_helper: money PLN at reader
  rule base = sum(in_pln[t] for t in transfers over mo where t.cash.to == wallet)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  d1 = 2026-03-05 "s"
  amt[yes] = 100.00 EUR "s"
  amt[no] = 300.00 EUR "s"
  mo = 2026-03 "s"
  fx = 4.0 "s"
  p_bonus = 0.5 "s"
  opening[wallet] = 0.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask pm: mean(by_helper), mean(by_inline) law 2026-06-01 paths 40 seed 11
ask p3: by_helper, by_inline law 2026-06-01 paths 40 seed 11 path 3
ask pw: mean(by_helper), mean(by_inline) with work = yes law 2026-06-01 paths 40 seed 11
=== expect
p3 [work = yes]: (800.00 PLN, 800.00 PLN)
  sample: bonus = 1 (u = 0.79803752615219676134063024608433778439575689844787120819091796875 (0.798037526152197))
  reading: work = yes
  unfulfilled: in1
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-06-10
p3 [work = no]: (2 400.00 PLN, 2 400.00 PLN)
  sample: bonus = 1 (u = 0.79803752615219676134063024608433778439575689844787120819091796875 (0.798037526152197))
  reading: work = no
  unfulfilled: in1
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-06-10
pm [work = yes]: (620 PLN (standard error 31.8651; 40 paths; horizon 2026-03-05), 620 PLN (standard error 31.8651; 40 paths; horizon 2026-03-05))
  reading: work = yes
  unfulfilled: in1
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-06-10
pm [work = no]: (1 860 PLN (standard error 95.595301; 40 paths; horizon 2026-03-05), 1 860 PLN (standard error 95.595301; 40 paths; horizon 2026-03-05))
  reading: work = no
  unfulfilled: in1
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-06-10
pw: (620 PLN (standard error 31.8651; 40 paths; horizon 2026-03-05), 620 PLN (standard error 31.8651; 40 paths; horizon 2026-03-05))
  pinned: work = yes
  unfulfilled: in1
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-06-10
